{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/9c4383a95995634056d3a44bc1fc1582.apng?t=1755848313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/9c4383a95995634056d3a44bc1fc1582.poster.avif?t=1755848313\" class=\"bb_img\" width=48 height=48 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wareware is our block-based <strong>3D game maker</strong>. In it you can create games so fast that you'll have ten of them and still have time to refund this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your own in-game tiles, <strong>build a spooky castle</strong> out of them and make the little dudes in the castle talk to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create any kind of narrative you want! Use wareware to break up with your significant other so you can make more games with wareware!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/2095751eca82aaca31a7c4fd13650726.poster.avif?t=1755848313\" width=600 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/2095751eca82aaca31a7c4fd13650726.webm?t=1755848313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/2095751eca82aaca31a7c4fd13650726.mp4?t=1755848313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build rooms out of blocks and ramps,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the rooms,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place sprites in them,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw and animate sprites directly in the editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your finished game is an html file that you can share anywhere, even on mobile!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scripting tool so u can make your tiny creatures say really weird things,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixely, Low-res, high-res, ultraHD-res, anything is possible with a graphics card,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh you can also show pictures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And play your <i>legally obtained</i> mp3 music,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And SFX,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen-reader supported!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on head! You can put stuff on your little head!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will make bump combat happen one day, i swear!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean--a cute little ghost is the app icon, COME ON!!!!!!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (\u273f\u25e1\u203f\u25e1) wareware is your new favourite hyper-speed game editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's cute, it's fast, it's dangerous.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/b646f771812e381e10d95a8c96fb4bb8.apng?t=1755848313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/b646f771812e381e10d95a8c96fb4bb8.poster.avif?t=1755848313\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726810?t=1755848313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726810?t=1755848313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/72982482faa90eea9d53af