751eca82aaca31a7c4fd13650726.mp4?t=1755848313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build rooms out of blocks and ramps,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the rooms,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place sprites in them,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw and animate sprites directly in the editor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your finished game is an html file that you can share anywhere, even on mobile!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scripting tool so u can make your tiny creatures say really weird things,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixely, Low-res, high-res, ultraHD-res, anything is possible with a graphics card,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh you can also show pictures,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And play your <i>legally obtained</i> mp3 music,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And SFX,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen-reader supported!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on head! You can put stuff on your little head!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will make bump combat happen one day, i swear!!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean--a cute little ghost is the app icon, COME ON!!!!!!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (\u273f\u25e1\u203f\u25e1) wareware is your new favourite hyper-speed game editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's cute, it's fast, it's dangerous.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/b646f771812e381e10d95a8c96fb4bb8.apng?t=1755848313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/extras/b646f771812e381e10d95a8c96fb4bb8.poster.avif?t=1755848313\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["riprip"],"genres":[{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726810/6bdbe4065680e500fe4477f83ef778aaf4957732/header.jpg?t=1755848313","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13 or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-4340 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible OpenGL / VRAM 1GB or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Soundblaster 69 or better<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1280x768 or better Display</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726810/615975604/df20cbbb8e769d13b42604f745ccbd4f4cfbc913/1755629571/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755637374","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726810/615975604/df20cbbb8e769d13b42604f745ccbd4f4cfbc913/1755629571/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755637374","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726810/615975604/df20cbbb8e769d13b42604f745ccbd4f4cfbc913/1755629571/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755637374","id":257185594,"name":"Prerelease Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185594/5f1e88e67352e3cf563f097e92670ac2002047f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755637374"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726810/1473096759/e9f20c15bba1de7948795fae1b7901d4b804bc5a/1755636100/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755637377","dash_h264":"https://video.akam